    "detailed_description": "<strong>You find yourself stuck in a school classroom, you and your friends try to escape by solving puzzles and finding the correct answers.</strong><br><br>To escape the classroom, you will have to inspect, interact, combine, and interpret objects to obtain clues to solve new puzzles.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>puzzles<br></li><li>hint System<br></li><li>reset Items<br></li><li>Single-player and Multiplayer co-op for 2-4 players</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FAQ</h2><strong>How long is the game?</strong><br><i>Like any escape room, it is intended to be played once. The average time of completion is around 50 minutes.</i>",
